			"notes": "## CloudBeats v0.7.0 - Universal Multi-Version Port\n\nCloudBeats is now available across all major modern and legacy Minecraft versions!\n\n### Included Builds:\n- soundcloud-0.7.0-1.21-26.3-fabric.jar: Minecraft 1.21.x & 26.3 (Fabric & Quilt)\n- soundcloud-0.7.0-1.20.1-fabric.jar: Minecraft 1.20.1 & 1.20 (Fabric & Quilt)\n- soundcloud-0.7.0-1.19.2-fabric.jar: Minecraft 1.19.2 / 1.19.x (Fabric & Quilt)\n- soundcloud-0.7.0-1.18.2-fabric.jar: Minecraft 1.18.2 / 1.18.x (Fabric & Quilt)\n- soundcloud-0.7.0-1.16.5-fabric.jar: Minecraft 1.16.5 (Fabric & Quilt)\n\n### Highlights:\n- Pure Java AAC / HLS Streamer (JAAD): Crystal-clear sound without white noise.\n- Modern Dark Glass GUI: Spotify-inspired design, interactive cards, live 4-bar equalizer.\n- Customizable In-Game HUD: 9 screen anchor positions and S/M/L presets.\n- Dedicated Git Branches: 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1, and main."
		},
