			"notes": "## ðŸŽµ CloudBeats v0.6.9\n\n### ðŸš€ What's New & Bug Fixes:\n- **Fixed White Noise Bug**: Solved the high-pitched buzzing/noise issue during playback. Configured JAAD AAC decoder output buffer to Little-Endian (SampleBuffer.setBigEndian(false)), perfectly matching Windows SourceDataLine 16-bit PCM specification.\n- **Fixed Play/Pause Lag**: Removed blocking calls on play/pause actions. Added instant audio line pausing/unblocking and seamless playback trigger from IDLE / STOPPED states.\n- **Pure Java AAC / HLS Streaming**: Bundled de.sfuhrm:jaad:0.8.7 pure-Java AAC decoder to demux fMP4 (.m4s) streams from modern SoundCloud endpoints (aac_96k / aac_160k) without requiring external native binaries.\n- **Minecraft 26.3 & 1.21.11 Support**: Fully verified and compatible with Fabric 1.21.11 through 26.3.\n- **Modern Dark Glass GUI & In-Game HUD**: Complete dark glass visual overhaul, live 4-bar equalizer, interactive cards, and 1-click controls."
